cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this tracker, its scoring method or its data snapshots, please cite it as below."
title: "trending-research: an open, evidence-weighted tracker of AI research papers, repositories and hype"
abstract: >-
  Ranks AI research papers and GitHub repositories on agents, harnesses and context layers, JEPA,
  JEV (decision models) and world/action models, and compares sampled attention (Hype) with evidence
  of substance (Real) across the wider AI world. Scores are confidence-aware: missing evidence shrinks
  a score toward the median instead of being filled in.
type: software
authors:
